            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT Musa ebe, “Koany, abuni mamakon kodou loepol, tetere epupunete ituŋa kiinerakin eoŋ kajo, kiyuunete da jo apaarasia kere.”",
          "type": "text",
