            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala EJAKAIT Musa ebe, “Kijesar, kicorak ituŋa, kinyeis ailamar mama ejai EJAKAIT aiteere, kosodete luipu kakesi aolior. ",
          "type": "text",
