            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala Musa EJAKAIT ebe, “Mam epedorete ituŋa adokun moru Sinai: naarai ibu kicorak sio ebe, ‘Kibwaik eikor airimor emoru, kitalau da.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
