          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobala EJAKAIT ebe, “Kolot, kiiesar; idokuni, ijo ka Aaron da: konye kinyeis isasedotin ka ituŋa ailamun adokuni mama ejai EJAKAIT, kinyek ŋesi ailamar mamakec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
